> Error in exists(name, envir = env, mode = mode) :
>    argument "env" is missing, with no default

I believe it is because you have limited the x-range to values that
aren't represented in your data (ie you have nothing between -3 and 3,
certainly not in the little bit of data included).

If I simulate score from 1:100, it works; if I simulate it from 10:100,
it fails as in your query.

Try removing the xlim=c(-3,3) bit.

Ron.

