Howdy,
please try doing everything in expression, which is vectorized.

Like this:
print(tab.base + annotation_custom(grob=tableGrob(df,
cols=expression('Eye', "N75[ms]", N75-P100*'['*mu*'V]'))))

For bold stuff:
print(tab.base + annotation_custom(grob=tableGrob(df,
cols=expression('Eye', bold(N75*"[ms]"), N75-P100*'['*mu*'V]'))))

Hope that helps.

Cheers,
Brian

